Power BI Dashboard
Import Data

Open Power BI Desktop

Get Data → Text/CSV → sales_data.csv

Measures (DAX)

Create these measures:
Total Revenue = SUM(sales_data[Revenue])
Total Orders = COUNT(sales_data[Order_ID])
Total Quantity = SUM(sales_data[Quantity])
